  "limitations": [
    "Binary response format for beauty and approach-avoidance decisions might lack fidelity for real-life settings.",
    "The design might not have fully engaged the decision maker for approach-avoidance, leading to a null effect for contour.",
    "The study did not manipulate degree-of-curvature systematically, limiting examination of nonlinear amygdala responses.",
    "Built environments and landscapes might not be comparable in their promotion of biological survival evaluation, potentially leading to different approach decisions and neural correlates.",
    "The study did not investigate how recruitment of specific structures differs between experts in architecture and laypeople."
